{"a":[21,21],"h":"<p>21.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"81\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 80.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 30.0 30.0 37.4 49.4 49.4 56.3\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"37.4 56.3 64.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> Bu pişinden başka diğer bir ganîmeti daha isâbe buyurdu ki<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 150.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 31.4 31.4 38.2 45.0 63.0 69.7 78.0 78.0 86.2 86.2 95.2 95.2 102.0 117.7 117.7 126.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 38.2 45.0 102.0 126.7 134.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ona henüz gücünüz yetmedi -ya'ni daha elinize geçmedi<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"164\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 164.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.3 23.3 31.4 31.4 47.3 47.3 54.0 54.0 54.0 60.7 68.3 84.0 97.4 104.3 116.3 132.0 132.0 141.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.3 84.0 104.3 116.3 141.0 147.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> lâkin Allah onu muhakkak surette ihata ve istîlâ buyurdu - ya'ni zaferinizi takdir ve kat'ıyyen va'd buyurdu, mü'minler için hıfz etmektedir. Ki buda Hevâzin veya Fâris ganâimidir.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"257\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 257.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.7 37.4 37.4 46.4 62.2 62.2 69.0 69.0 80.2 100.4 100.4 100.4 111.0 111.0 131.2 142.4 142.4 149.2 158.2 167.2 167.2 174.0 174.0 174.0 180.7 188.2 204.0 214.4 221.2 232.4\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"46.4 80.2 149.2 204.0 221.2 232.4 240.7\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> daha da Allah her şey'e kadir bulunuyor. - Onu verdikten sonra daha neler neler verebilir. 22. </p>"}